ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lQSL-7IOrH0Q7kNvwFkcNMo&_nc_oc=AdrJbVXc1TOGRUsv9eDtj8T3xhbss8GPtQOhF56nik0smDUwwKvWOUo2-Ki7B-rf7BA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1PDcIhTzpHCZpgUUdW8P7IN07_4yUoBJgdtxTU25BigQ&oe=69F89FB9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BzrOs8ahqrQQ7kNvwHzAEN2&_nc_oc=AdqJ0z5zhfyMr_oo-_mDJmWIpn0NPMn8DcsmUczjxreMwKL8qj9uK6ou-uWwmjBkLZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2ckv4oYQo3Fumkj2INFjSTiChh7-dxEaobwnuaqaUHxg&oe=69F88E0F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XEyA_khlvpcQ7kNvwFfYpBE&_nc_oc=Adr7--voQi_Ua-drlSVeaaYtx-wO2OD3uDiNVRSooS49VknxDRnjzUD0_EjmyI6Y2P0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0MnvKT31CgIf_8IU7618m3eaSV0yRlSpfv0EHblCVOVw&oe=69F89BEE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa